BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20260101T000000Z
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Personal
SUMMARY:🕯️ Erev Rosh Hashana Yahrzeit reminder
DTSTART:20250922T163000
DTEND:20250922T163000
UID:reminder-20250922-69c47b58-1
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Erev Rosh Hashana\, whose 10th
  Yahrzeit occurs on Tuesday\, September 23\, corresponding to the 1st of T
 ishrei\, 5786.\n\nErev Rosh Hashana’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Mond
 ay\, September 22 and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It
  is customary to light a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n
 \nMay your loved one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and 
 may their memory serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to
  you.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Event reminder
TRIGGER:P0DT0H0M0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
